    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait really?? I dont know, an ER visit is so expensive and i feel like ive had this before during pollen season. it's just a little scratchy and tight, it's not like i can't breathe or anything. my throat just feels heavy. are you sure it's not just my hay fever acting up? can't i just take some more allergy meds and sleep it off?",
